{"start": 0.84, "end": 2.45, "speaker": "S01", "text": "How long do we think each one will take?"}
{"start": 2.52, "end": 3.81, "speaker": "S02", "text": "I don't know, who cares?"}
{"start": 4.63, "end": 5.81, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Four hours apiece?"}
{"start": 5.87, "end": 7.25, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Yeah, maybe for you."}
{"start": 7.88, "end": 8.818, "speaker": "S03", "text": "Each one of those"}
{"start": 8.843, "end": 10.52, "speaker": "S03", "text": "tasks would take me three, max."}
{"start": 10.719999999999999, "end": 12.120000000000001, "speaker": "S01", "text": "Not tasks, stories."}
{"start": 12.24, "end": 14.18, "speaker": "S03", "text": "I've got a story. Why don't you choke on my balls?"}
{"start": 14.61, "end": 16.365, "speaker": "S02", "text": "He's trying to get us to compete,"}
{"start": 16.365, "end": 17.34, "speaker": "S02", "text": "so we work faster."}
{"start": 17.740000000000002, "end": 23.895882352941175, "speaker": "S02", "text": "He thinks this wall of psych 101 MBA mind control bullshit is going to motivate"}
{"start": 23.961333333333336, "end": 24.240000000000002, "speaker": "S02", "text": "us."}
{"start": 24.55, "end": 27.48, "speaker": "S01", "text": "Fine, don't compete. Do them at whatever speed you like."}
{"start": 29.65, "end": 31.555116279069768, "speaker": "S02", "text": "So we're gonna work at a nice leisurely"}
{"start": 31.555116279069768, "end": 32.22, "speaker": "S02", "text": "pace, right?"}
{"start": 32.72, "end": 33.32, "speaker": "S00", "text": "Sure."}
{"start": 36.019999999999996, "end": 37.46, "speaker": "S02", "text": "But why are you tapping faster?"}
{"start": 37.519999999999996, "end": 38.16, "speaker": "S03", "text": "I'm not."}
{"start": 38.88, "end": 39.19020408163266, "speaker": "S03", "text": "Maybe"}
{"start": 39.31591836734694, "end": 41.92, "speaker": "S03", "text": "my leisurely pace is just a little faster than yours."}
{"start": 44.44, "end": 46.31, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Holy cocksucker."}
{"start": 47.78, "end": 49.78, "speaker": "S01", "text": "Huh, huh, I'm booyah."}
{"start": 50.92, "end": 53.12, "speaker": "S04", "text": "Guys, have you been out front yet?"}
{"start": 53.56, "end": 53.77, "speaker": "S04", "text": "Cause"}
{"start": 53.77333333333333, "end": 54.84, "speaker": "S04", "text": "you might wanna come see this."}
{"start": 54.88, "end": 55.68, "speaker": "S02", "text": "I'm good."}
{"start": 55.72, "end": 57.16, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Fuck off, we're working."}
{"start": 57.2, "end": 58.03, "speaker": "S00", "text": "What was that?"}
{"start": 59.769999999999996, "end": 60.34, "speaker": "S00", "text": "What?"}
{"start": 60.64, "end": 61.495396825396824, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Tara just whispered"}
{"start": 61.53301587301587, "end": 63.76, "speaker": "S02", "text": "something to you and then she looked at me in a weird way."}
{"start": 64.81, "end": 65.44, "speaker": "S00", "text": "No, she didn't."}
{"start": 66.42, "end": 67.16, "speaker": "S00", "text": "Yeah, she did."}
{"start": 72.66, "end": 73.82, "speaker": "S03", "text": "Do you know what compersion is?"}
{"start": 75.35, "end": 76.28851351351351, "speaker": "S03", "text": "It's when someone"}
{"start": 76.31662162162162, "end": 80.04, "speaker": "S03", "text": "takes pleasure in seeing their loved one gratified by another person."}
{"start": 81.09, "end": 81.81, "speaker": "S03", "text": "Sexually."}
{"start": 82.78, "end": 84.15, "speaker": "S03", "text": "It's the opposite of jealousy."}
{"start": 84.49, "end": 85.06666666666666, "speaker": "S02", "text": "It sounds like"}
{"start": 85.2, "end": 87.62, "speaker": "S02", "text": "The opposite of normal. Why are you telling me about?"}
{"start": 87.64, "end": 88.39, "speaker": "S02", "text": "this thing."}
{"start": 88.42, "end": 89.02, "speaker": "S00", "text": "Okay."}
